% Who bears a duty: the agent of this role of the action (lomo.le).
the bearer role is addresser.


member states is identified by "http://example.org/MemberStates".

member states is an agent type.

member states has the label "Member States".

member states has the comment "EU Member States as a category - any Member State may bear this obligation".


